<title>JAPAN: Japan brass mill output up 4.4 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Japan brass mill output up 4.4 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's brass mill output in June rose 4.4 percent from the same month a year ago to a seasonally adjusted 97,414 tonnes, according to preliminary data issued on Friday by the Japan Brass Makers Association.</p>
<p>The association releases preliminary data for output only. It also released final data for May, as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   May 97	 yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output*	103,130	  +5.1 pct</p>
<p> Shipments    104,110	  +4.9 pct</p>
<p> Inventories   35,617	 -14.0 pct</p>
<p>*(NOTE: Output figure revised, seasonally adjusted.)</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
